2:[["$","div",null,{"className":"aeo-answer tl-dr","children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Quick Answer:"}]," PlanBot is an AI-powered daily planner app for Android with 4 pricing tiers: Free (2 plans/day, Basic AI), Pro (₹99/mo, 4 plans/day, Standard AI, no ads), Elite (₹129/mo, 5 plans/day, Advanced AI, weekly reports), and God (₹249/mo, unlimited plans, Premium AI, OCR input). Key features include AI plan generation, streak system, gamification, and natural language input. Rated 4.8/5 on Google Play Store."]}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"PlanBot at a Glance"}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Detail"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Info"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"App Name"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"PlanBot — AI Daily Planner"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Developer"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"PlannextTech"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Platform"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Android"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Category"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Productivity / AI Planner"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Price"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Free / ₹99 / ₹129 / ₹249 per month"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"AI Models"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Basic AI, Standard AI, Advanced AI, Premium AI"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Play Store"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cpm.planbot","children":"Download"}]}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"What is PlanBot?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["PlanBot is an ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"AI-powered daily planner app"}]," that uses advanced language models to generate personalized daily schedules. Instead of manually creating to-do lists, you describe your goals to the AI, and it creates an optimized plan with time blocks, priorities, breaks, and activity sequencing."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The app combines AI planning with ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gamification"}]," (streaks, XP, levels) to keep you consistently engaged with your goals."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Core Features Review"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"🤖 AI Plan Generation — ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"This is PlanBot's killer feature. The natural language interface is intuitive — you simply type what you want to achieve, and the AI creates a structured daily plan."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Example input:"}]," ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"I have a physics exam in 5 days, need to finish a coding project by Friday, and want to workout 3 times this week. I'm free from 9 AM to 10 PM.\""}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"AI output:"}]," A complete daily plan with study blocks, coding sessions, workout slots, meals, and breaks — all time-blocked and prioritized."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What we love:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Multiple AI tiers to choose from (Basic → Standard → Advanced → Premium progression)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Plans are genuinely personalized, not generic templates"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Regeneration is seamless when plans change"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Natural language understanding is excellent"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What could improve:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Limited to 2 plans/day on the free tier"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"No real-time calendar sync yet"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"🔥 Streak System — ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"The streak system is deceptively simple but incredibly effective. Every day you complete your plan, your streak grows. Miss a day, it resets."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What makes it great:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Visible streak counter creates real psychological stakes"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Streak freeze prevents total loss from one missed day"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Loss aversion kicks in after 10+ days (you CANNOT break it)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Weekly and monthly streak milestones feel genuinely rewarding"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"This is the #1 retention feature in PlanBot. Users who build a 7-day streak have extremely high retention rates."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"📊 Weekly AI Reports — ⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Available on Elite and God tiers, weekly reports analyze your performance:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Tasks completed vs. planned"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Subject/goal distribution"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Consistency patterns"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"AI-generated improvement suggestions"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What we love:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Data-driven insights, not vague motivational quotes"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Trend analysis shows improvement over time"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Specific, actionable suggestions"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What co